## 9. Complaints

If you believe we have handled your personal information in breach of the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth), please contact us first at **berniework.bd@gmail.com**. We will investigate and respond within 30 days.

If you are not satisfied with our response, you may lodge a complaint with the **Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (OAIC)** at [www.oaic.gov.au](https://www.oaic.gov.au) or by calling 1300 363 992.

